---
import SectionLabel from '../components/SectionLabel.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="border-b-2 border-[#111111] bg-[#F2F0EA] py-16 md:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8">
    <SectionLabel index="01 // PROFILE" title="ABOUT RAIN07" />

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-stretch">
      <!-- Left Asymmetric Editorial Column -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 border-2 border-[#111111] bg-[#FFFFFF] p-8 md:p-10 lg:p-12 shadow-hard flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#0057FF] uppercase tracking-widest block mb-3 md:mb-4">
            // PROFESSIONAL BACKGROUND
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight leading-[1.05] text-[#111111]">
            IT PROFESSIONAL WORKING ACROSS WEB, INFRASTRUCTURE & TECHNICAL PROJECTS.
          </h3>
        </div>

        <p class="font-mono text-sm md:text-base text-[#111111]/85 leading-relaxed my-8 md:my-10">
          I work on websites and web systems while also handling the infrastructure, servers, and technical planning behind them.
        </p>

        <div class="border-t-2 border-[#111111]/20 pt-6 md:pt-7 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#111111]/70 leading-relaxed">
          My background covers WordPress development, Laravel, Linux administration, IT infrastructure, project estimation, and technical project work. I have worked across both web and IT infrastructure projects, including development, system administration, technical planning, and estimation.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: System Tenets / Editorial Blocks -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-6 md:gap-7">
        <div class="border-2 border-[#111111] bg-[#111111] text-[#F2F0EA] p-6 md:p-7 shadow-hard flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center">
          <div class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#D9FF00] uppercase tracking-wider mb-2.5">
            01 // PRACTICAL
          </div>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#F2F0EA]/90">
            I prefer practical solutions built around the actual requirements of a project. I focus on what needs to work, what needs to be maintained, and what makes sense for the environment it will run in.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-2 border-[#111111] bg-[#FFFFFF] text-[#111111] p-6 md:p-7 shadow-hard flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center">
          <div class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#0057FF] uppercase tracking-wider mb-2.5">
            02 // TECHNICAL
          </div>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#111111]/90">
            My work covers web development, WordPress, Laravel, Linux servers, and supporting infrastructure. This allows me to work across the application layer and the systems that support it.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-2 border-[#111111] bg-[#0057FF] text-[#FFFFFF] p-6 md:p-7 shadow-hard flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center">
          <div class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#FFFFFF] uppercase tracking-wider mb-2.5">
            03 // CONTINUOUS
          </div>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFFF]/90">
            I keep learning through real projects and hands-on problem solving. Working across different systems gives me room to improve both development skills and practical IT knowledge.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
